                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "What ho, traveler.\r\nThis game rules. It has a really fun combat system and a great ruleset, the story is amazingly fun and the way you interact with the world is fantastic, making a character build feels really thoughtful, a true cross between Fallout 1 and Baldur's Gate. The art and music, too, are truly incredible. Major downside? This game is, unfortunately, very buggy. I lost my progress multiple times. Maybe it's a Linux issue, I'm not sure, but if you feel comfortable and up for it, become Necholai and explore the Staglands.",
